Package: sustainas
Type: Package
Title: Sustainability Analysis for Rapid Appraisal for Fisheries ('RAPFISH'), Sustainable Livelihood Analysis, and Influence-Interest
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-10-30
Authors@R: person("Weksi","Budiaji", email = "budiaji@untirta.ac.id", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: There are some tools to measure a program sustainability. These include 
  Rapid Appraisal for Fisheries <doi:10.14288/1.0074801>,  
  Sustainable Livelihood Analysis <doi:10.1016/j.gloenvcha.2008.11.002>,
  and Stakeholder Influence-Interest <doi:10.1080/14719030410001675722>. 
  The validity measures and uncertainty analysis are also included.
